Opens Manual Updates for user-directed folder and inventory corrections. Original accepts one folder or one .txt batch file. New Name accepts a typed leaf name or a dropped folder leaf independently of Original, except that New Name is disabled for a .txt batch. Update Tags is checked by default; when checked, Save refreshes tags in each corrected folder before finalizing the inventory update. Uncheck it to leave tags unchanged.}\cell\row\pard \trowd\trql\trleft82\ltrrow\trkeep\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadft3\clpadt108\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx5253\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadft3\clpadt108\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx10424\pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs20\alang1033 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\intbl\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\loch
