- Add Shows has no separate Preview buttons, no Dry run checkbox, and no duplicated main-option checkboxes. Check for Duplicates remains because it applies only to Process New Shows. Select Dry run on the main Inventory window, then click Process New Shows or Process Potential Duplicate/Upgrades to run the detailed non-destructive analysis. Each action reads the current main-window values when clicked and shows the same complete checkbox-value section in Review Operation before starting.}
